+`vectorize_max_reduction_neon`) at `debug_assert!(scaled, "max transform
+requires the marching-pointer step GEP")` — the byte-IV form is correct without
+a scaled GEP, release never saw it, and the audit had already credited #686 for
+relaxing it. Adopted `scaled || use_byte_iv` at both sites. And **my
+`find_loop_preheader` still had the unfixed F2 hole** (only `Branch`/`CondBranch`,
