+deleting the function *and* adding a `strict_cfg_dominates` conjunct, but
+completing the terminator match is provably sufficient — in a natural loop every
+body block is dominated by the header, so a path reaching the header either
+comes straight from an out-of-loop predecessor or arrives via a body block,
